#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:2
msgid "Deploy for Sovereign Collaboration in Microsoft"
msgstr "Microsoft 내 주권적 협업을 위한 배포"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "개요"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:7
msgid ""
"Agencies and critical infrastructure organizations often face strict data"
" sovereignty requirements that restrict the use of public cloud services "
"for sensitive collaboration."
msgstr ""
"기관과 핵심 인프라 조직은 종종 민감한 협업에 퍼블릭 클라우드 서비스 사용을 "
"제한하는 엄격한 데이터 주권 요구 사항에 직면합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:9
msgid ""
"Deploying Mattermost for sovereign collaboration within Microsoft Teams "
"and Outlook enables secure, compliant, and resilient communication while "
"maintaining workflow continuity inside familiar Microsoft interfaces. "
"Users access both Teams channels and Mattermost channels :doc:`from "
"within the Microsoft ecosystem </integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-"
"collaboration-for-m365>`, providing a single-pane-of-glass experience and"
" eliminating application switching."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft Teams 및 Outlook 내에서 주권적 협업을 위해 OKR.BEST를 배포하면 익숙한 "
"Microsoft 인터페이스 안에서 워크플로 연속성을 유지하면서 안전하고 규정을 준수하며 "
"복원력 있는 통신이 가능합니다. 사용자는 :doc:`Microsoft 에코시스템 내에서 "
"</integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365>` Teams 채널과 "
"OKR.BEST 채널에 모두 접근하여, 단일 화면(single-pane-of-glass) 경험을 누리고 "
"애플리케이션 전환을 없앱니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:11
msgid ""
"Mattermost can be hosted on-premises or in sovereign clouds, such as "
"Azure GovCloud or Azure Local, ensuring that messages, files, recordings,"
" and transcriptions remain in compliance-approved systems with encryption"
" and strict policy enforcement."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST는 온프레미스 또는 Azure GovCloud나 Azure Local 같은 주권 클라우드에 "
"호스팅할 수 있어, 메시지, 파일, 녹화, 전사가 암호화 및 엄격한 정책 시행과 함께 "
"규정 승인 시스템 내에 유지되도록 보장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:13
msgid ""
"Unified authentication with Microsoft Entra-ID extends your Microsoft "
"enterprise IT investments while delivering the compliance, control, and "
"resilience required for mission-critical operations or out-of-band "
"scenarios."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft Entra-ID를 통한 통합 인증은 Microsoft 엔터프라이즈 IT 투자를 확장하는 "
"동시에 미션 크리티컬 운영이나 대역 외 시나리오에 필요한 규정 준수, 제어, 복원력을 "
"제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:15
msgid ""
"This document outlines architectural guidance for enabling sovereign "
"collaboration within your Microsoft ecosystem."
msgstr ""
"이 문서는 Microsoft 에코시스템 내에서 주권적 협업을 가능하게 하기 위한 아키텍처 "
"지침을 설명합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:17
msgid ""
"Mattermost diagram displays the deployment components and relationships "
"outlined in detail in this document."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 다이어그램은 이 문서에서 자세히 설명하는 배포 구성 요소와 관계를 "
"보여줍니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:21
msgid ""
"Consider `talking to a Mattermost expert <https://mattermost.com/contact-"
"sales/>`__ if your organization needs support deploying Mattermost and "
"supporting services for soverign collaboration within your Microsoft "
"ecosystem."
msgstr ""
"조직이 Microsoft 에코시스템 내에서 주권적 협업을 위해 OKR.BEST 및 지원 서비스를 "
"배포하는 데 도움이 필요하다면 `Mattermost 전문가와 상담 "
"<https://mattermost.com/contact-sales/>`__\\ 하는 것을 고려하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:24
msgid "Architecture components"
msgstr "아키텍처 구성 요소"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:26
msgid "The deployment architecture includes the following components:"
msgstr "이 배포 아키텍처는 다음 구성 요소를 포함합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Users:** Enterprise users within the network boundary accessing client "
"applications for M365 services and Mattermost."
msgstr ""
"**사용자:** M365 서비스 및 OKR.BEST용 클라이언트 애플리케이션에 접근하는 네트워크 "
"경계 내의 엔터프라이즈 사용자입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Microsoft Entra ID (Identity Provider):** Users authenticate to M365 "
"applications and Mattermost using :doc:`single sign-on Entra ID "
"</administration-guide/onboard/sso-entraid>` via OpenID Connect (OIDC) or"
" SAML."
msgstr ""
"**Microsoft Entra ID(ID 공급자):** 사용자는 OpenID Connect(OIDC) 또는 SAML을 "
"통해 :doc:`Entra ID 싱글 사인온 </administration-guide/onboard/sso-entraid>`\\ "
"을 사용하여 M365 애플리케이션과 OKR.BEST에 인증합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:32
msgid "**Client Applications:**"
msgstr "**클라이언트 애플리케이션:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Microsoft 365 Desktop Apps:** Teams and Outlook with :doc:`embedded "
"Mattermost application </integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-"
"collaboration-for-m365>` for seamless collaboration within a familiar "
"interface while enforcing regulatory compliance."
msgstr ""
"**Microsoft 365 데스크톱 앱:** 규제 준수를 시행하면서 익숙한 인터페이스 내에서 "
"매끄러운 협업을 위한 :doc:`내장 OKR.BEST 애플리케이션 </integrations-guide"
"/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365>`\\ 을 갖춘 Teams 및 Outlook입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:36
msgid ""
"**Mattermost Desktop Apps:** Access Mattermost via :doc:`desktop "
"</deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-deployment>` or web apps in "
"addition to the embedded views from Teams and Outlook. *(Optional - not "
"shown)*"
msgstr ""
"**OKR.BEST 데스크톱 앱:** Teams 및 Outlook의 내장 뷰 외에도 :doc:`데스크톱 "
"</deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-deployment>` 또는 웹 앱을 통해 "
"OKR.BEST에 접근합니다. *(선택 사항 - 표시되지 않음)*"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Mattermost Mobile Apps:** Access Mattermost via :doc:`iPhone and "
"Android apps </deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-app-deployment>`, with "
"support for :doc:`ID-only push notifications </deployment-guide/mobile"
"/host-your-own-push-proxy-service>` to ensure compliance with data "
"sovereignty requirements. *(Optional - not shown)*"
msgstr ""
"**OKR.BEST 모바일 앱:** :doc:`iPhone 및 Android 앱 </deployment-guide/mobile"
"/mobile-app-deployment>`\\ 을 통해 OKR.BEST에 접근하며, 데이터 주권 요구 사항 "
"준수를 보장하기 위해 :doc:`ID 전용 푸시 알림 </deployment-guide/mobile/host-"
"your-own-push-proxy-service>`\\ 을 지원합니다. *(선택 사항 - 표시되지 않음)*"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:40
msgid ""
"**Mattermost Deployment:** Mattermost deployed for sovereign "
"collaboration on enterprise-controlled infrastructure or private cloud, "
"such as :doc:`Azure </deployment-guide/server/deploy-kubernetes>` or "
"`Azure Local <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-local/manage"
"/disconnected-operations-overview>`_, to maintain compliance with STIG, "
"FedRAMP, and NIST 800-53 standards. See :doc:`reference architecture "
"</administration-guide/scale/server-architecture>` documentation for "
"Mattermost deployment configurations based on expected scale."
msgstr ""
"**OKR.BEST 배포:** STIG, FedRAMP, NIST 800-53 표준 준수를 유지하기 위해 "
":doc:`Azure </deployment-guide/server/deploy-kubernetes>` 또는 `Azure Local "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-local/manage/disconnected-"
"operations-overview>`_ 같은 엔터프라이즈 제어 인프라나 프라이빗 클라우드에서 "
"주권적 협업을 위해 배포된 OKR.BEST입니다. 예상 규모를 기준으로 한 OKR.BEST 배포 "
"구성은 :doc:`참조 아키텍처 </administration-guide/scale/server-architecture>` "
"문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:42
msgid ""
"**Mattermost Server:** Core application server handling collaboration "
"workloads, including:"
msgstr ""
"**OKR.BEST 서버:** 협업 워크로드를 처리하는 핵심 애플리케이션 서버이며, 다음을 "
"포함합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:44
msgid ""
":doc:`Messaging Collaboration </end-user-guide/messaging-collaboration>`:"
" DDIL-ready 1:1, group messaging, and structured channel collaboration "
"with :doc:`rich integration capabilities </integrations-guide"
"/integrations-guide-index>` and :ref:`enterprise-grade search "
"<administration-guide/scale/scaling-for-enterprise:enterprise search>`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`메시지 협업 </end-user-guide/messaging-collaboration>`: :doc:`풍부한 통합 "
"기능 </integrations-guide/integrations-guide-index>` 및 :ref:`엔터프라이즈급 "
"검색 <administration-guide/scale/scaling-for-enterprise:enterprise search>`\\ "
"을 갖춘 DDIL 대비 1:1, 그룹 메시지, 구조화된 채널 협업입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:46
msgid ""
":doc:`Workflow Automation </end-user-guide/workflow-automation>`: "
"Playbooks provide structure, monitoring and automation for repeatable "
"processes built-in to your sovereign Mattermost deployment."
msgstr ""
":doc:`워크플로 자동화 </end-user-guide/workflow-automation>`: Playbooks는 주권적 "
"OKR.BEST 배포에 기본 내장되어 반복 가능한 프로세스에 대한 구조, 모니터링, "
"자동화를 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:48
msgid ""
":doc:`Project Tracking </end-user-guide/project-task-management>`: Boards"
" enables project management capabilities built-in to your sovereign "
"Mattermost deployment."
msgstr ""
":doc:`프로젝트 추적 </end-user-guide/project-task-management>`: Boards는 주권적 "
"OKR.BEST 배포에 기본 내장된 프로젝트 관리 기능을 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:50
msgid ""
":doc:`AI Agents </administration-guide/configure/agents-admin-guide>`: AI"
" Agents run against Azure OpenAI endpoints or a self-hosted LLM that is "
"OpenAI-compatible."
msgstr ""
":doc:`AI 에이전트 </administration-guide/configure/agents-admin-guide>`: AI "
"에이전트는 Azure OpenAI 엔드포인트 또는 OpenAI 호환 셀프 호스팅 LLM에 대해 "
"실행됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:52
msgid ""
":doc:`Audio & Screenshare </administration-guide/configure/calls-"
"deployment-guide>`: Calls offers native real-time self-hosted audio calls"
" and screen sharing within your own network."
msgstr ""
":doc:`오디오 및 화면 공유 </administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-"
"guide>`: Calls는 자체 네트워크 내에서 네이티브 실시간 셀프 호스팅 오디오 통화와 "
"화면 공유를 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:54
msgid ""
"**Proxy Server:** The :doc:`proxy server </deployment-guide/server/setup-"
"nginx-proxy>` handles HTTP(S) routing within the cluster, directing "
"traffic between the server and clients accessing Mattermost services. "
"NGINX is recommended for load balancing with support for WebSocket "
"connections, health check endpoints, and sticky sessions. The proxy layer"
" provides SSL termination and distributes client traffic across "
"application servers."
msgstr ""
"**프록시 서버:** :doc:`프록시 서버 </deployment-guide/server/setup-nginx-"
"proxy>`\\ 는 클러스터 내 HTTP(S) 라우팅을 처리하여 OKR.BEST 서비스에 접근하는 "
"서버와 클라이언트 간의 트래픽을 전달합니다. WebSocket 연결, 상태 점검 "
"엔드포인트, 고정 세션을 지원하는 부하 분산에는 NGINX를 권장합니다. 프록시 계층은 "
"SSL 종료를 제공하고 클라이언트 트래픽을 애플리케이션 서버 전반에 분산합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:56
msgid ""
"**PostgreSQL Database:** Stores persistent application data on a "
":doc:`PostgreSQL v13+ database </deployment-guide/server/preparations>`, "
"such as `Azure Database for PostgreSQL <https://azure.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/products/postgresql>`_."
msgstr ""
"**PostgreSQL 데이터베이스:** `Azure Database for PostgreSQL "
"<https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/products/postgresql>`_ 같은 "
":doc:`PostgreSQL v13 이상 데이터베이스 </deployment-guide/server/preparations>`"
"\\ 에 영구 애플리케이션 데이터를 저장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:58
msgid ""
"**Object Storage:** File uploads, images, and attachments are stored "
"outside the application node on an :doc:`S3-compatible store "
"</deployment-guide/server/preparations>` or an NFS (Network File System) "
"server. `Azure Blob Storage <https://azure.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/products/storage/blobs>`_ can be used, but needs an S3-compatible "
"proxy for Mattermost to interface with."
msgstr ""
"**오브젝트 스토리지:** 파일 업로드, 이미지, 첨부 파일은 :doc:`S3 호환 저장소 "
"</deployment-guide/server/preparations>` 또는 NFS(Network File System) 서버의 "
"애플리케이션 노드 외부에 저장됩니다. `Azure Blob Storage "
"<https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/products/storage/blobs>`_\\ 를 사용할 수 "
"있지만, OKR.BEST가 연동하려면 S3 호환 프록시가 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Recording Instance:** ``calls-offloader`` job service, configured using"
" the :doc:`Calls Offloader Setup and Configuration </administration-"
"guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup>` guide, to offload heavy "
"processing tasks from Mattermost Calls, such as recordings, "
"transcriptions, and live captioning, to enterprise-controlled "
"infrastructure or private cloud. *(Optional)*"
msgstr ""
"**녹화 인스턴스:** :doc:`Calls Offloader 설정 및 구성 </administration-"
"guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup>` 가이드를 사용해 구성한 ``calls-"
"offloader`` 작업 서비스로, 녹화, 전사, 실시간 자막 같은 무거운 처리 작업을 "
"OKR.BEST Calls에서 엔터프라이즈 제어 인프라나 프라이빗 클라우드로 오프로드합니다. "
"*(선택 사항)*"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:62
msgid ""
"**Self-hosted integrations:** :doc:`Custom apps, plugins, and webhooks "
"</integrations-guide/integrations-guide-index>` can be deployed within "
"the enterprise boundary. *(Optional - not shown)*"
msgstr ""
"**셀프 호스팅 통합:** :doc:`사용자 지정 앱, 플러그인, 웹훅 </integrations-guide"
"/integrations-guide-index>`\\ 은 엔터프라이즈 경계 내에 배포할 수 있습니다. "
"*(선택 사항 - 표시되지 않음)*"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:64
msgid ""
"**Secure Access Layer:** A firewall or access gateway protecting entry "
"into the enterprise network. This may include network policies, IP "
"allowlists, or WAFs depending on your networking configurations. "
"*(Optional)*"
msgstr ""
"**보안 접근 계층:** 엔터프라이즈 네트워크로의 진입을 보호하는 방화벽 또는 접근 "
"게이트웨이입니다. 네트워킹 구성에 따라 네트워크 정책, IP 허용 목록, WAF를 포함할 "
"수 있습니다. *(선택 사항)*"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:66
msgid ""
"**Microsoft Global Network:** `World-wide network "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/networking/microsoft-global-"
"network>`_ of Microsoft data centers, delivering public cloud services "
"including M365 and Azure OpenAI."
msgstr ""
"**Microsoft 글로벌 네트워크:** M365와 Azure OpenAI를 포함한 퍼블릭 클라우드 "
"서비스를 제공하는 Microsoft 데이터 센터의 `전 세계 네트워크 "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/networking/microsoft-global-"
"network>`_\\ 입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:68
msgid ""
"**Azure OpenAI Service:** :doc:`LLM service </agents/docs/providers>` "
"used for summarization, ai-enhanced search, and agent-assisted workflows,"
" hosted within the Microsoft Global Network. *(Optional)*"
msgstr ""
"**Azure OpenAI Service:** Microsoft 글로벌 네트워크 내에 호스팅되어 요약, AI 강화 "
"검색, 에이전트 지원 워크플로에 사용되는 :doc:`LLM 서비스 "
"</agents/docs/providers>`\\ 입니다. *(선택 사항)*"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:71
msgid "Operational Best Practices"
msgstr "운영 모범 사례"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:73
msgid ""
"The following best practices and deployment configurations help ensure "
"that Mattermost remains compliant, resilient, and fully sovereign when "
"deployed alongside Microsoft 365."
msgstr ""
"다음 모범 사례와 배포 구성은 Microsoft 365와 함께 배포할 때 OKR.BEST가 규정을 "
"준수하고 복원력 있으며 완전히 주권적인 상태를 유지하도록 보장하는 데 도움이 "
"됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:76
msgid "High availability and fault tolerance"
msgstr "고가용성 및 내결함성"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:78
msgid ""
"Deploy Mattermost in a :doc:`cluster-based architecture </administration-"
"guide/scale/high-availability-cluster-based-deployment>` to ensure "
"continued availability during outages or hardware failures. High "
"availability requires redundant infrastructure across each critical "
"component:"
msgstr ""
"장애나 하드웨어 결함 중에도 지속적인 가용성을 보장하려면 OKR.BEST를 :doc:`클러스터 "
"기반 아키텍처 </administration-guide/scale/high-availability-cluster-based-"
"deployment>`\\ 로 배포하세요. 고가용성을 위해서는 각 핵심 구성 요소에 이중화 "
"인프라가 필요합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:80
msgid ""
"Application servers: Scale horizontally across multiple nodes with a load"
" balancer distributing client traffic."
msgstr ""
"애플리케이션 서버: 클라이언트 트래픽을 분산하는 부하 분산기와 함께 여러 노드에 "
"걸쳐 수평으로 확장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:81
msgid ""
"Database layer: Use PostgreSQL replication or managed HA services with "
"automatic failover."
msgstr ""
"데이터베이스 계층: PostgreSQL 복제 또는 자동 장애 조치를 갖춘 관리형 HA 서비스를 "
"사용합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:82
msgid ""
"Search service: :ref:`Elasticsearch or AWS OpenSearch Service "
"<administration-guide/scale/scaling-for-enterprise:enterprise search>` "
"provides optimized search performance with dedicated indexing for large-"
"scale deployments."
msgstr ""
"검색 서비스: :ref:`Elasticsearch 또는 AWS OpenSearch Service <administration-"
"guide/scale/scaling-for-enterprise:enterprise search>`\\ 는 대규모 배포를 위한 "
"전용 인덱싱으로 최적화된 검색 성능을 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:83
msgid ""
"Object storage: Configure S3-compatible backends with erasure coding or "
"replication for durability. All application servers must access shared "
"file storage (NAS or S3) to ensure consistent data availability."
msgstr ""
"오브젝트 스토리지: 내구성을 위해 소거 코딩 또는 복제를 갖춘 S3 호환 백엔드를 "
"구성하세요. 일관된 데이터 가용성을 보장하려면 모든 애플리케이션 서버가 공유 파일 "
"저장소(NAS 또는 S3)에 접근할 수 있어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:84
msgid ""
"Calls services: Run multiple ``rtcd`` and ``calls-offloader`` nodes for "
"resilience."
msgstr ""
"Calls 서비스: 복원력을 위해 여러 ``rtcd`` 및 ``calls-offloader`` 노드를 "
"실행합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:87
msgid "Sovereign audio & screensharing"
msgstr "주권적 오디오 및 화면 공유"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:89
msgid ""
"Data sovereignty compliance may require that all voice and screen sharing"
" traffic remain within enterprise-controlled infrastructure and does not "
"traverse third-party services. Deploy :doc:`Mattermost Calls "
"</administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide>` in a self-"
"hosted configuration to ensure that Microsoft Teams users and Mattermost "
"users collaborate without media ever leaving the sovereign network."
msgstr ""
"데이터 주권 준수를 위해서는 모든 음성 및 화면 공유 트래픽이 엔터프라이즈 제어 "
"인프라 내에 유지되고 서드파티 서비스를 경유하지 않아야 할 수 있습니다. Microsoft "
"Teams 사용자와 OKR.BEST 사용자가 미디어를 주권 네트워크 밖으로 내보내지 않고 "
"협업하도록 보장하려면 :doc:`OKR.BEST Calls </administration-guide/configure"
"/calls-deployment-guide>`\\ 를 셀프 호스팅 구성으로 배포하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:91
msgid ""
"The ``rtcd`` service, configured using the :doc:`RTCD Setup and "
"Configuration </administration-guide/configure/calls-rtcd-setup>` guide, "
"provides scalable, low-latency media routing hosted on-premises. Run "
"multiple ``rtcd`` nodes for redundancy."
msgstr ""
":doc:`RTCD 설정 및 구성 </administration-guide/configure/calls-rtcd-setup>` "
"가이드를 사용해 구성한 ``rtcd`` 서비스는 온프레미스에 호스팅되는 확장 가능하고 "
"지연 시간이 짧은 미디어 라우팅을 제공합니다. 이중화를 위해 여러 ``rtcd`` 노드를 "
"실행하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:92
msgid ""
"The ``calls-offloader`` service, configured using the :doc:`Calls "
"Offloader Setup and Configuration </administration-guide/configure/calls-"
"offloader-setup>` guide, offloads heavy processing tasks like recording, "
"transcription and live captioning to a compliance-approved job server."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Calls Offloader 설정 및 구성 </administration-guide/configure/calls-"
"offloader-setup>` 가이드를 사용해 구성한 ``calls-offloader`` 서비스는 녹화, "
"전사, 실시간 자막 같은 무거운 처리 작업을 규정 승인 작업 서버로 "
"오프로드합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:95
msgid "Compliance and retention"
msgstr "규정 준수 및 보존"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:97
msgid ""
"Sovereign environments often require strict enforcement of retention "
"policies, legal hold, and export controls. Configure Mattermost's built-"
"in compliance features to meet agency or sectoral mandates."
msgstr ""
"주권적 환경에서는 보존 정책, 법적 보존(legal hold), 내보내기 제어를 엄격하게 "
"시행해야 하는 경우가 많습니다. 기관 또는 부문별 의무를 충족하도록 OKR.BEST의 기본 "
"내장 규정 준수 기능을 구성하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:99
msgid ""
"Enable :doc:`compliance export </administration-guide/comply/compliance-"
"export>` and :doc:`monitoring </administration-guide/comply/compliance-"
"monitoring>` to produce auditable exports of message data and user "
"activity logs."
msgstr ""
"메시지 데이터와 사용자 활동 로그의 감사 가능한 내보내기를 생성하려면 :doc:`규정 "
"준수 내보내기 </administration-guide/comply/compliance-export>` 및 "
":doc:`모니터링 </administration-guide/comply/compliance-monitoring>`\\ 을 "
"활성화하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:100
msgid ""
"Configure :doc:`message retention </administration-guide/comply/data-"
"retention-policy>` and :doc:`legal hold </administration-guide/comply"
"/legal-hold>` policies to align with applicable regulations."
msgstr ""
"적용 가능한 규정에 맞도록 :doc:`메시지 보존 </administration-guide/comply/data-"
"retention-policy>` 및 :doc:`법적 보존 </administration-guide/comply/legal-"
"hold>` 정책을 구성하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:101
msgid ""
"Integrate with your organization's :doc:`eDiscovery </administration-"
"guide/comply/electronic-discovery>` and archiving systems as required."
msgstr ""
"필요에 따라 조직의 :doc:`eDiscovery </administration-guide/comply/electronic-"
"discovery>` 및 아카이빙 시스템과 통합하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:104
msgid "Mobile notifications"
msgstr "모바일 알림"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-sovereign-collaboration.rst:106
msgid ""
"To prevent sensitive message content from being transmitted to external "
"notification services such as Apple Push Notification Service (APNS) and "
"Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM), configure Mattermost to use :doc:`ID-only"
" push notifications </deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-"
"service>`. In this configuration, only a message identifier is sent to "
"public push notification services and the client retrieves the content "
"securely from the Mattermost server over an encrypted channel."
msgstr ""
"민감한 메시지 내용이 Apple Push Notification Service(APNS)나 Firebase Cloud "
"Messaging(FCM) 같은 외부 알림 서비스로 전송되는 것을 방지하려면, OKR.BEST가 "
":doc:`ID 전용 푸시 알림 </deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-"
"service>`\\ 을 사용하도록 구성하세요. 이 구성에서는 메시지 식별자만 퍼블릭 푸시 "
"알림 서비스로 전송되며, 클라이언트는 암호화된 채널을 통해 OKR.BEST 서버에서 "
"내용을 안전하게 가져옵니다."

